{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kKcbBCpT9I1795533314.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>世界無人機競速錦標賽，下月廣州舉行，港隊舉行授旗儀式。</p><p></p><p>賽事由FAI國際航空運動聯合會主辦，是國際奧委會認可的最高級別世錦賽之一。</p><p></p><p>港隊派出五名飛手出戰，包括成都世運會獲得銀牌的隊長關俊仁，首位港隊女將陳靜雲，還有蔡日朗、羅子舜及黃勝堯，代表隊期望爭取佳績，透過世錦賽累積比賽經驗，並向世界展示，香港青年在創新科技及競技運動領域的卓越潛能。</p><p></p><p>賽事12月9至12日，廣東奧林匹克體育中心舉行。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:44:26.604564+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T00:37:15.009448+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T16:37:41.153656+00:00","content_hash":"98b390bd11a1ba67b072eb21c32bd764cc7fbba3c6905434ad98d20c1a1153d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:44:26.604564+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}